  "id": "magnocellular-system",
  "term": "magnocellular system",
  "definition": "The magnocellular system is the visual pathway associated with processing motion, beginning in the retina and continuing through dorsal stream visual areas. It is described as functionally and anatomically separate from the parvocellular pathway, which is linked to color processing.",
